    "model_alias": "deepseek-v4.1-flash",
    "chat_template": "{#- Legacy standalone DeepSeek-V4.1 Jinja export. Maya's server renders DeepSeek with serve/ds41_encoding.py,\n    pinned to revision 1bae0e1088993b9b82de08f59de5be5a34e42170 of deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017.\n    This export covers ordinary chat/tools only; see docs/deepseek-prompt-format.md for its conformance limits.\n    DeepSeek-V4.1's prompt format (the model repo's encoding/encoding.py), approximated in Jinja.\n    Turns: <\uff5cUser\uff5c> ... <\uff5cAssistant\uff5c> (reasoning</think>)answer<\uff5cend\u2581of\u2581sentence\uff5c>.  Thinking mode ends the prompt\n    with <think> and starts with a reasoning-effort line (low 50, high 75, max 100); chat mode ends it with </think>.\n    Tool results (role \"tool\") are <tool_result> blocks of a user turn, merged with the user messages around them;\n    tool calls are DSML blocks; the tools are listed in the system turn.  Earlier turns keep their reasoning only when\n    tools are given (encoding.py's drop_thinking).  A picture in a message's content list is its placeholder\n    <\uff5cdeepseek_image\uff5c>, a block of its own between the text blocks (the server expands it into the picture's span). -#}\n{%- set thinking = enable_thinking is not defined or enable_thinking -%}\n{%- set efforts = {'low': 50, 'medium': 75, 'high': 75, 'xhigh': 100, 'max': 100} -%}\n{%- if reasoning_effort is defined and reasoning_effort is number -%}\n{%- set budget = reasoning_effort -%}\n{%- elif reasoning_effort is defined and reasoning_effort in efforts -%}\n{%- set budget = efforts[reasoning_effort] -%}\n{%- else -%}\n{%- set budget = 75 -%}\n{%- endif -%}\n{%- set has_tools = tools is defined and tools is not none and tools | length > 0 -%}\n{%- set keep = has_tools -%}\n{%- set ns = namespace(last_user=-1, schemas='') -%}\n{%- if has_tools -%}{%- for t in tools -%}{%- set ns.schemas = ns.schemas ~ (t | tojson) ~ ('' if loop.last else '\\n') -%}{%- endfor -%}{%- endif -%}\n{%- for m in messages -%}{%- if m.role == 'user' -%}{%- set ns.last_user = loop.index0 -%}{%- endif -%}{%- endfor -%}\n{%- macro text(c) -%}\n{%- if c is string -%}{{ c }}{%- elif c is iterable -%}\n{%- for p in c if p.type in ['text', 'image'] -%}{%- if not loop.first -%}{{ '\\n\\n' }}{%- endif -%}{{ p.text if p.type == 'text' else '<\uff5cdeepseek_image\uff5c>' }}{%- endfor -%}\n{%- endif -%}\n{%- endmacro -%}\n{%- macro tools_block() -%}\n## Tools\n\nYou have access to a set of tools to help answer the user's question. You can invoke tools by writing a \"<\uff5cDSML\uff5c calls>\" block like the following:\n\n<\uff5cDSML\uff5c calls>\n<\uff5cDSML\uff5c invoke name=\"$TOOL_NAME\">\n<\uff5cDSML\uff5c parameter name=\"$PARAMETER_NAME\" string=\"true|false\">$PARAMETER_VALUE</\uff5cDSML\uff5c parameter>\n...\n</\uff5cDSML\uff5c invoke>\n<\uff5cDSML\uff5c invoke name=\"$TOOL_NAME2\">\n...\n</\uff5cDSML\uff5c invoke>\n</\uff5cDSML\uff5c calls>\n\nString parameters should be specified as is and set `string=\"true\"`. For all other types (numbers, booleans, arrays, objects), pass the value in JSON format and set `string=\"false\"`.\n\nIf thinking_mode is enabled (triggered by <think>), you MUST output your complete reasoning inside <think>...</think> BEFORE any tool calls or final response.\n\nOtherwise, output directly after </think> with tool calls or final response.\n\n### Available Tool Schemas\n\n{{ ns.schemas }}\n\nYou MUST strictly follow the above defined tool name and parameter schemas to invoke tool calls.\n{% endmacro -%}\n{{- '<\uff5cbegin\u2581of\u2581sentence\uff5c>' -}}\n{%- set effort_line = ('Reasoning Effort: ' ~ budget ~ ' (range 1-100, the higher the value, the more thorough the reasoning)\\n\\n') if thinking else '' -%}\n{%- if messages and messages[0].role == 'system' -%}\n{{- '<\uff5cSystem\uff5c>' ~ effort_line ~ text(messages[0].content) -}}\n{%- if has_tools -%}{{- '\\n\\n' ~ tools_block() -}}{%- endif -%}\n{%- elif has_tools -%}\n{{- '<\uff5cSystem\uff5c>' ~ effort_line ~ '\\n\\n' ~ tools_block() -}}\n{%- elif thinking -%}\n{{- '<\uff5cSystem\uff5c>' ~ effort_line -}}\n{%- endif -%}\n{%- for m in messages -%}\n{%- set i = loop.index0 -%}\n{%- set prev = messages[i - 1].role if i > 0 else '' -%}\n{%- set next = messages[i + 1].role if i + 1 < messages | length else '' -%}\n{%- if m.role == 'system' and i == 0 -%}\n{%- elif m.role in ['user', 'tool', 'system'] -%}\n{%- if prev in ['user', 'tool'] or (prev == 'system' and i - 1 > 0) -%}{{- '\\n\\n' -}}{%- else -%}{{- '<\uff5cUser\uff5c>' -}}{%- endif -%}\n{%- if m.role == 'tool' -%}{{- '<tool_result>' ~ text(m.content) ~ '</tool_result>' -}}{%- else -%}{{- text(m.content) -}}{%- endif -%}\n{%- if next not in ['user', 'tool', 'system'] -%}\n{%- if thinking and (keep or i >= ns.last_user) -%}{{- '<\uff5cAssistant\uff5c><think>' -}}{%- else -%}{{- '<\uff5cAssistant\uff5c></think>' -}}{%- endif -%}\n{%- endif -%}\n{%- elif m.role == 'assistant' -%}\n{%- if thinking and (keep or i > ns.last_user) -%}{{- (m.reasoning_content or '') ~ '</think>' -}}{%- endif -%}\n{{- text(m.content) -}}\n{%- if m.tool_calls -%}\n{{- '\\n\\n<\uff5cDSML\uff5c calls>\\n' -}}\n{%- for c in m.tool_calls -%}\n{%- set f = c.function if c.function is defined else c -%}\n{{- '<\uff5cDSML\uff5c invoke name=\"' ~ f.name ~ '\">\\n' -}}\n{%- for k, v in (f.arguments or {}).items() -%}\n{{- '<\uff5cDSML\uff5c parameter name=\"' ~ k ~ '\" string=\"' ~ ('true' if v is string else 'false') ~ '\">' ~ (v if v is string else v | tojson) ~ '</\uff5cDSML\uff5c parameter>' -}}\n{%- if not loop.last -%}{{- '\\n' -}}{%- endif -%}\n{%- endfor -%}\n{{- '\\n</\uff5cDSML\uff5c invoke>' -}}{%- if not loop.last -%}{{- '\\n' -}}{%- endif -%}\n{%- endfor -%}\n{{- '\\n</\uff5cDSML\uff5c calls>' -}}\n{%- endif -%}\n{{- '<\uff5cend\u2581of\u2581sentence\uff5c>' -}}\n{%- endif -%}\n{%- endfor -%}\n",
